      "text": "5. Add control-flow logic: Custom logic for how agents work together, handle\nconditions, and route to other agents.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. Add control-flow logic: Custom logic for how agents work together, handle conditions, and route to other agents.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WHz9KaLnccc7ibxN3-JDf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -724.1555108164026,
      "y": 512.0390490080697,
      "width": 280.06292602539094,
      "height": 30.11328125000009,
      "angle": 0,
