      "text": "how to build a agent",
      "fontSize": 24.09062500000007,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "how to build a agent",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "84Y8FVMDggiXVbE4JliG-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -723.7969903085901,
      "y": 567.4140490080697,
      "width": 794.259521484375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "i2jJc2zOFYlES9grE7HaK",
        "f7A5UJx3OOCLMTaOpH5St"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bdt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1784987693,
      "version": 433,
      "versionNonce": 1251411654,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778811211753,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Building an agent is a process of designing workflows and connecting pieces of\nthe OpenAI platform to meet your goals. Agent Builder brings all these primitives\ninto one UI.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Building an agent is a process of designing workflows and connecting pieces of the OpenAI platform to meet your goals. Agent Builder brings all these primitives into one UI.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "65hUWXGdNh-O67yAX5KWj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -724.1835259531214,
      "y": 667.5156115080697,
      "width": 753.0794677734375,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "i2jJc2zOFYlES9grE7HaK",
        "f7A5UJx3OOCLMTaOpH5St"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bdu",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 134596803,
      "version": 572,
      "versionNonce": 324415642,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778811211753,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Build an agent workflow: Visual canvas for creating agent workflows.\nBrings models, tools, knowledge, and logic all into one place.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Build an agent workflow: Visual canvas for creating agent workflows. Brings models, tools, knowledge, and logic all into one place.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "lAWuiTiYxF7JrD1901PSb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -726.7383355234339,
      "y": 758.1367052580697,
      "width": 741.2593994140625,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "i2jJc2zOFYlES9grE7HaK",
        "f7A5UJx3OOCLMTaOpH5St"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bdv",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 984242413,
      "version": 555,
      "versionNonce": 416693766,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778811211753,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Connect to LLMs: Core intelligence capable of reasoning, making\ndecisions, and processing data. Select your model in Agent Builder.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Connect to LLMs: Core intelligence capable of reasoning, making decisions, and processing data. Select your model in Agent Builder.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ONQVbA8s1AnsDvciOnu_M",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -728.3904351328089,
      "y": 842.9609240080697,
      "width": 751.8995361328125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "i2jJc2zOFYlES9grE7HaK",
        "f7A5UJx3OOCLMTaOpH5St"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bdw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1584773219,
      "version": 536,
      "versionNonce": 892931418,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778811211753,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Equip your agent: Access to third-party services with connectors and\nMCP, search vector stores, and prevent misuse.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Equip your agent: Access to third-party services with connectors and MCP, search vector stores, and prevent misuse.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1mUcqZfEqrJ9Suv-8pFgE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -729.0825738046839,
      "y": 912.1718615080697,
      "width": 756.7994384765625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "i2jJc2zOFYlES9grE7HaK",
        "f7A5UJx3OOCLMTaOpH5St"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bdx",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 925545293,
      "version": 526,
      "versionNonce": 548179270,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778811211753,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Provide knowledge and memory: Vector stores, file search, embeddings\nExternal and persistent knowledge for more relevant information for your use\ncase, hosted by OpenAI.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Provide knowledge and memory: Vector stores, file search, embeddings        External and persistent knowledge for more relevant information for your use case, hosted by OpenAI.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yB3U-qiInTt8ZRWMs04gg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -727.4382256601526,
      "y": 1072.5273302580697,
      "width": 742.9794921875,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "i2jJc2zOFYlES9grE7HaK",
        "f7A5UJx3OOCLMTaOpH5St"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bdy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1265680813,
      "version": 576,
      "versionNonce": 2015515162,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778811211753,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6. Write your own code: Build agentic applications, with tools and\norchestration, instead of using Agent Builder as the backend.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6. Write your own code: Build agentic applications, with tools and orchestration, instead of using Agent Builder as the backend.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
